class: runtime
summary: D479 D487 on Windows the command processor ComSpec names is a child of hosted/events that writes a line and waits to read one; one fibre reads its output and errors through the completion port and waits for its end through the loop's job while another ticks three times on the provider's clock before writing the child its line, so the reader's errors arrive only after the third tick and the child exits 3; a missing program is not_found with ERROR_FILE_NOT_FOUND for events.last_errno
program: main.ldn
